{"canonical_record":{"canonical_payload_sha256":"36dd3794a29760b085d2b9520ad69c81fc3bef856f0f21eb25915b4952b85d85","full_review_record_id":"fullrev_058306240ce13c370bf2139d0baf841c8c78074b4a97461424efbb0f70bb9cd3","overall_assessment":"The paper presents a technical model for short text classification without a dedicated section for ethics, privacy, or broader impact. The supplied evidence is insufficient to determine compliance with specific venue policies regarding anonymity, plagiarism, or mandatory impact statements, as no such policy documents are provided. The paper does disclose the use of crawled Twitter data, which raises data usage considerations, but lacks details on consent or licensing.","paper_id":"H1Go7Koex","paper_identity_sha256":"9348ae914f88bbadb3f8e1495805db0a3735e973ad5e126565f22d5c065146ed","prompt_identity_sha256":"c30c60aaeac5556675ea5b34069a511c88fbb040b7716204369e789df26e029b","raw_response_sha256":"963e2d5bb78f5ac2c85bdb1fca31f24ae5d3e4f7bf3084b6b0c5f2db7707a6ca","request_identity_sha256":"4f94708eedc04e8c464f75a32af45d6c828e4b9b2ea5e0b6317b1c7ad4be41bd","reviewer_identity_sha256":"c1cd7c7fdd4a2cbeb45c2f21af982ad0f30bffae8ae148e3eba36479685cf360","role":"POL","schema_version":"agentreview-full-review-corpus-v4","structural_context_sha256":"d404b697ea86e69fe9cb78e1ca1ca7629f217df63562869b32564d19a910d080","subdimension_sections":[{"paper_anchor_ids":[],"review_text":"The paper does not contain a dedicated section discussing ethical risks, fairness, bias, or potential harms associated with the model. The application is text classification on short texts, and no specific ethical concerns or mitigation strategies are addressed in the provided text.","subdimension_id":"POL-ETH"},{"paper_anchor_ids":["SRC-019"],"review_text":"The paper states that the Tweets dataset was crawled from Twitter using a set of keywords. It does not provide information regarding user consent, data licensing, or compliance with privacy regulations for this crawled data. The other datasets (Question, AG_news) are described as being from different sources or previous work, but specific licensing or consent details are not provided.","subdimension_id":"POL-DAT"},{"paper_anchor_ids":["SRC-001"],"review_text":"The paper lists author names, affiliations (Nanyang Technological University, SAP), and email addresses on the first page. Without a frozen venue policy confirming double-blind requirements for this specific submission, it is not possible to declare an anonymity violation. However, the presence of this information is noted.","subdimension_id":"POL-ANO"},{"paper_anchor_ids":[],"review_text":"The supplied evidence does not include external plagiarism checks or information regarding dual submission. The paper cites relevant prior work, but the absence of external overlap evidence means originality and dual submission status cannot be determined from the paper text alone.","subdimension_id":"POL-PLG"},{"paper_anchor_ids":[],"review_text":"The paper does not include a broader impact statement, ethics checklist, or explicit mention of IRB approval. As no frozen policy obligation is provided in the evidence, it is not possible to determine if these omissions constitute a compliance violation. The paper focuses on technical methodology and results.","subdimension_id":"POL-IMP"}]},"disposition":"CANONICAL_FULL_REVIEW_COMMITTED","item_commit_sha256":"af445b82a43ab0f962b8658db80382b12af8dae58431ec15d9dea7ee24798f7d","paper_id":"H1Go7Koex","paper_ordinal":88,"raw_attempts":[{"assistant_content_base64":"","assistant_content_sha256":"963e2d5bb78f5ac2c85bdb1fca31f24ae5d3e4f7bf3084b6b0c5f2db7707a6ca","attempt_index":0,"error":"","finish_reason":"stop","paper_id":"H1Go7Koex","raw_provider_response_base64":"","raw_provider_response_sha256":"edb2147bccd310c50b42ef6e38c61c708da82f21de8d99be567d581dd43ae477","request_identity_sha256":"4f94708eedc04e8c464f75a32af45d6c828e4b9b2ea5e0b6317b1c7ad4be41bd","role":"POL","schema_version":"no-memory-full-revi